an begin="01:44.108" end="01:44.657">doko</span><span begin="01:44.657" end="01:45.018">made</span><span begin="01:45.018" end="01:45.199">mo</span><span begin="01:45.199" end="01:46.358">tsuzui</span><span begin="01:46.358" end="01:47.967">teku</span></text><text for="L24"><span begin="01:47.967" end="01:48.857">kurukuru</span><span begin="01:48.857" end="01:50.197">kurikaesu</span></text></transliteration></transliterations><translations><translation type="subtitle" xml:lang="zh-Hans"><text for="L1">拔下卡带 按下复位键</text><text for="L2">误入迷宫 如何前进都会回到原点</text><text for="L3">在这扇门尽头看到自己的身影</text><text for="L4">回首望去后竟然浮现出了希望</text><text for="L5">所谓的地狱尽头究竟存在于何处</text><text for="L6">还没有到出口吗？</text><text for="L7">转啊转啊不停转 循环往复</text><text for="L8">循环往复 循环往复 循环往复</text><text for="L9">漫无目的地晃荡 乱中有序</text><text for="L10">乱中有序 乱中有序 乱中有序</text><text for="L11">空转的灵魂 永无尽头的道路</text><text for="L12">氧气中充斥着铁锈味 求救信号无法传达</text><text for="L13">靠着掉落在地的石榴勉强果腹</text><text for="L14">脑海深处传来阵阵嗡鸣</text><text for="L15">若是如何前进都难以改变现状</text><text for="L16">抗争的意义何在</text><text for="L17">转啊转啊不停转 循环往复</text><text for="L18">循环往复 循环往复 循环往复</text><text for="L19">漫无目的地晃荡 乱中有序</text><text for="L20">乱中有序 乱中有序 乱中有序</text><text for="L21">啊啊 推开那扇门 连意义也忘却吧</text><text for="L22">坠入疯狂的梦境深处</text><text for="L23">不论何处全都延伸而去</text><text for="L24">转啊转啊 循环往复</text></translation></translations></iTunesMetadata></metadata></head><body dur="01:50.197"><div begin="00:15.392" end="01:50.197"><p begin="00:15.392" end="00:20.022" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1"><span begin="00:15.392" end="00:16.072">引き抜く</span><span begin="00:16.072" end="00:16.943">カセット </span><span begin="00:18.415" end="00:19.047">押し込む</span><span begin="00:19.047" end="00:20.022">リセット</span></p><p begin="00:21.407" end="00:26.234" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2"><span begin="00:21.407" end="00:22.247">迷い込む</span><span begin="00:22.247" end="00:22.975">迷路 </span><span begin="00:24.336" end="00:24.742">進め</span><span begin="00:24.742" end="00:24.912">ど</span><s